  "motion_mapping": "For stroke D, cruise speed v, ramp r: c=D/v-r; travel=2r+c. Forward distance: 0.5*v*(t-r/pi*sin(pi*t/r)) for t<r; v*r/2+v*(t-r) for r<=t<r+c; D-v*r/2+0.5*v*(q+r/pi*sin(pi*q/r)) for q=t-r-c in [0,r]. Travel forward, dwell 2s, travel backward, dwell 2s. Add initial phase, wrap modulo physical period; rescale runtime seconds by physical period / timeline duration.",
